> 	  Subdevices: 1/1
> 	  Subdevice #0: subdevice #0
> 
> Unbind CPU
> 
> 	echo "ec500000.rcar_sound" > /sys/bus/platform/drivers/rcar_sound/unbind 
> 
> But, it still has unbinded card
> 
> 	/ # aplay -l
> 	**** List of PLAYBACK Hardware Devices ****
